cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below (attribution is required)."
title: "A projective plane of order 28 admits no collineation of order 271 (computer-assisted; not peer reviewed)"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Kobayashi"
    given-names: "Yudai"
    alias: "yudaikobayashi"
abstract: "A computer search shows that there is no planar difference family in Z/271 with blocks of sizes 13, 9, 7; hence a projective plane of order 28 has no collineation of order 271. The search was repeated with a second program with identical counts. As a corollary, for every non-prime-power order n < 36, a projective plane of order n has no collineation of prime order p > n+1. Derivations and programs were mostly made by AI (Claude, Anthropic) under the author's direction. Not peer reviewed."
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - projective plane
  - collineation
  - order 28
  - difference family
